# H6199 effect definition uploaded over 0xA3, captured 2026-08-05 from the Govee Home iOS app
# driving the DreamView T1, immediately before applying the Scene gallery's "Sweet". It carries
# a body kind of 1, which neither of the other two shapes uses, and its content is left raw:
# one body cannot be told from padding, and guessing a layout from a single sample is what this
# grammar exists to avoid. Its companion scene write is h6199_scene_sweet, which is class 1 and
# so is the capture that proved class 1 does NOT mean the light already holds the effect.
id: h6199_effect_builtin_sweet
data: h6199_effect_builtin_sweet.bin
imports:
  - h6199_effect_upload
asserts:
  - actual: chunk_count
    expected: 2
  - actual: kind
    expected: 1
